  'mcpClient.emptyBody': 'Click "Add server" to get started — pick a template (Higgsfield OpenClaw, Pollinations, Allyson, Imagician, EdgeOne Pages, GitHub, Filesystem…) or set up a custom stdio / HTTP server.',
